{"id":"a57fde3586b9e79c","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-composition.md","title":"Composition","display":"df-composition — Composition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-composition","aliases":["93-df-composition"],"display":"df-composition — Composition","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-composition — Composition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,h\">\\(f,g,h\\)</span> are morphism candidates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\\)</span> (morphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{93}\\)</span> (composition predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition}\\vdash \\mathrm{Comp}_{93}(g,f,h,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,B,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(h,A,C,\\mathcal C)\\land h=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition}\\vdash \\mathrm{Comp}_{93}(g,f,h,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,B,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(h,A,C,\\mathcal C)\\land h=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is categorical composition only. Relation composition used for permutable congruences is sourced separately and must not be identified with this four-place predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}$ (morphism predicate, see [[93-df-morphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g,h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition}\\vdash \\mathrm{Comp}_{93}(g,f,h,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,B,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(h,A,C,\\mathcal C)\\land h=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1050,"backlinks":[{"id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Relation composition is a binary operation on subsets of $A^2$ and is not the four-place categorical composition predicate of [[93-df-composition]]."},{"id":"bf7570e62e6f3e21","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Both arguments must first satisfy the category axioms, and every projection now matches the exact source notation. The composable-pair set has its own name and cannot collide with the four-place predicate of [[93-df-composition]]."},{"id":"41a00088f1898c65","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c","b3500ab2f8429ba4"]}